[b]Wolfe Wave Scanner Pro[/b]

[b]What it does[/b]
Searches a depth window of confirmed swings for non-overlapping 5-point Wolfe Wave wedges — a contracting, alternating channel where point 5 tests the 1-3 trendline — that pass every hard geometry rule. Each pattern draws its own wedge and a live-updating EPA (Estimated Price at Arrival) level, and is tracked through its own lifecycle until price reaches the EPA, the pattern invalidates, or it expires.

Wolfe Waves are strongly interpretation-dependent. This is a display of the geometry: no quality grade, no trade metrics, no entry call — a detected pattern means "a Wolfe-shaped geometry exists here," not "enter now."

[b]Detection lags point 5[/b]
Swings are confirmed a few bars after the extreme, and point 5 can sit several swings back in the search window, so a pattern is often detected well after point 5 formed. The chart label and the dashboard show how many bars P5 lies back.

[b]Hard rules[/b]
[list]
[*]Wedge structure: point 3 undercuts/exceeds point 1, point 5 extends beyond point 3
[*]Channel contraction (real narrowing ratio, monotonic through the midpoint) with consistent boundary slopes
[*]Point 4 well off the 1-3 line, and the 4-5 leg crosses most of the remaining channel
[*]Lines 1-3 and 2-4 converge ahead of point 5
[*]Directional point-5 test against the 1-3 line, with separate inside/overshoot tolerances
[*]Channel holds on both sides — checked on every swing and every bar between points 1 and 5
[*]Leg purity — rejects a point selection that skips a countermove nearly as large as the leg itself
[/list]
When several valid combinations compete, an internal geometric rank decides which one is drawn. It is never shown as a grade.

[b]Features[/b]
[list]
[*]Best-of-window swing search across non-consecutive combinations, not just the last 5 swings
[*]By default one pattern at a time; optionally several non-overlapping ones. A tracked pattern is never replaced, it ends only as EPA reached, Invalidated or Expired
[*]Live EPA line, recomputed from line 1-4 every bar
[*]Pattern lifecycle per tracked pattern (Active, 50% EPA, EPA reached, Expired, Invalidated)
[*]Dashboard with status, active pattern count, bars since P5, pattern direction, live EPA, EPA at ETA, and invalidation level
[*]Rule-breakdown debug table for threshold tuning
[*]Lifecycle alerts with bar-close confirmation: Bull/Bear Wolfe detected, 50% EPA, EPA reached, invalidated, expired
[/list]

